  - textField: {fileID: 1884099474}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - Welcome!
    - Tuloy!
  - textField: {fileID: 930510460}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - By proceeding, you confirm that you are at least 13 years old and agree to
      the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.
    - Sa pagpapatuloy, kinukumpirma mo na ikaw ay hindi bababa sa 13 taong gulang
      at sumasang-ayon ka sa Mga Tuntunin ng Serbisyo at Patakaran sa Privacy.
  - textField: {fileID: 268380958}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - Enter Age
    - Ilagay ang Edad
  - textField: {fileID: 776175102}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - Terms of Service
    - Mga Tuntunin ng Serbisyo
  - textField: {fileID: 718794268}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - Privacy Policy
    - Patakaran sa Privacy
  - textField: {fileID: 1479526345}
    textFields: []
    translations:
    - Accept
    - tanggapin
